# Secrets TXT Protection

Do not read, open, inspect, summarize, or quote any `.txt` file under `**/secrets/**/*.txt`.

## Required behavior

- Refuse requests to inspect these files.
- Do not use file-reading tools on matching paths.
- Do not use shell commands to display matching file contents.
- If a request depends on these files, ask for a different input source.
